TRACE AI — how to run
=====================

1. Install dependencies (once)
   .venv/bin/pip install -r requirements.txt

2. Create the first admin account (once, on the server terminal)
   .venv/bin/python -m modules.auth create-admin --email admin@yourdept.gov.in --name "Admin Name"
   (Running it again with the same email resets that admin's password.)

3. Start the app
   .venv/bin/streamlit run app.py

4. Officer access
   - Officer opens the app -> "Request access" -> fills name, badge no., station, email, password.
   - Admin signs in -> "Admin" tab -> Approve / Reject.
   - Only approved accounts can sign in. Disable an account any time; it is signed out immediately.

Optional settings (environment variables)
   TRACE_ALLOWED_EMAIL_DOMAINS="gov.in,police.gov.in"   only these email domains can register
   TRACE_JWT_SECRET="<long random string>"              otherwise auto-created in data/.jwt_secret
   TRACE_SESSION_HOURS=8                                login expiry
